{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43265","headline":"登云梯 · 汤洙","name":"登云梯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢客常游处，层峦枕碧溪。\n经过殊俗境，登陟象云梯。\n步步劳山屐，行行蹑涧霓。\n迥临天路广，俯眺夕阳低。\n赏咏情弥惬，风尘事已暌。\n前修如可慕，投足固思齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤洙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}